      "text": "I am not Jewish, I am a Baptist, Christian. \n\nNewsflash lots of non Jews support Israel.\n\n\nGod\u2019s Silliest War Criminal (@FreudWasSus)\n\nJews mad.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/FreudWasSus/status/2054980069945442336#m",
