      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I hope Israel sues the New York Times and Nicholas Kristof to absolute hell.\n\nTo HELL.\n\n\nIsrael Foreign Ministry (@IsraelMFA)\n\nFollowing the publication by Nicholas Kristof in The New York Times of one of the most hideous and distorted lies ever published against the State of Israel in the modern press, which also received the backing of the newspaper, Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu and Foreign Minister Gideon Sa\u2019ar have instructed the initiation of a defamation lawsuit against The New York T",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2054949300040237422",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-14T15:37:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Among all the criticism of the trailer for the new Odyssey  - it\u2019s just hard for me to be excited for a new adaptation when \u201cO Brother, where art thou\u201d already exists in its perfection.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2054758304308449562",
