      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Would be cool if people exposed to a deadly virus would hold off on traveling.\n\n*and also going to landfills to look at birds that locals know not to go to because of all the \ud83d\udc00 \ud83d\udca9 .",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2054321206720098405",
